{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31302","headline":"晚春陪王员外东塘游宴 · 刘威","name":"晚春陪王员外东塘游宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水绿山青春日长，政成因暇泛回塘。\n初移柳岸笙歌合，欲过苹洲罗绮香。\n共济已惊依玉树，随流还许醉金觞。\n一声画角严城暮，云雨分时满路光。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘威","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31302.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31302","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}